The models were trained on simulated export values and the Thai and Chinese holiday calendars only (every
pandemic dose is zero before 2020). The HESI dose used to forecast with them is published in the dataset
thanatchon36/lockdowns-as-partial-holidays; it is derived from Google LLC "Google COVID-19 Community Mobility
Reports" and remains under Google's terms of use.
